            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "White Trash Royalty"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I changed it up a little and it was fantastic.\nI used 3 squirrels no cabbage or bell pepper, substituted pearls onions, added 2 cups of sliced white mushrooms, 2 cups chopped celery used 1 cup of water and 1 cup of red wine. Very Very Tasty!!! I also flash fried the squirrel in a pan with butter and garlic prior to putting in slow cooker",
            "datePublished": "2018-01-30T05:38:17.260Z"
          },
          {
